<title>AUSTRALIA: S&amp;P assigns A1 rating to Marco A$500 mln cp issue.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A1 rating to Marco A$500 mln cp issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday that it assigned an A1 rating to the A$500 million commercial note programme undertaken by Marco Underwriting (No.1) Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>The programme is guaranteed by Bankers Trust Australia Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
